aratroopers uh in the  middle you have the people coming  through they're then put into if you  like a triage area which is between  these these crates um but they're not  likely to be people with the proper  paperwork so what they're going to do  with them they don't know so they've now  had to create another line  of of paris uh again with shields to  stop them coming through because if you  go beyond that then you move towards the  united states and other countries who  are processing their people because it's  all pretty much descended on this  section of the airport  and they are  working on those people but they're  trying to stop them getting through so  pandemonium not chaos but really really  dangerous and very difficult
 

